  "title": "Regular Verbs (-ati)",
  "prerequisiteIds": ["hr-lesson-numbers"],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "Most Croatian verbs ending in **-ati** (like *gledati*, *slušati*, *kuhati*) follow a regular pattern in the present tense:\n\nja **-am** · ti **-aš** · on/ona/ono **-a** · mi **-amo** · vi **-ate** · oni/one/ona **-aju**\n\ne.g. *gledati* → gled**am**, gled**aš**, gled**a**, gled**amo**, gled**ate**, gled**aju**." },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-verbs-1" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-verbs-2" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-verbs-3" },
    { "type": "exercise", "exerciseId": "hr-ex-verbs-4" }
  ],
  "exercises": [
